{# Email envoyé au propriétaire de la voiture lors d'une réservation #}
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px;
        }
        .ride-details {
            background-color: #f0f8ff;
            padding: 15px;
            border-left: 4px solid #007bff;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 3px;
        }
        .passenger-info {
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .info-row {
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #007bff;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>
            {# Pin Titre #}
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-pin-angle" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                <path d="M9.828.722a.5.5 0 0 1 .354.146l4.95 4.95a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .707c-.48.48-1.072.588-1.503.588-.177 0-.335-.018-.46-.039l-3.134 3.134a6 6 0 0 1 .16 1.013c.046.702-.032 1.687-.72 2.375a.5.5 0 0 1-.707 0l-2.829-2.828-3.182 3.182c-.195.195-1.219.902-1.414.707s.512-1.22.707-1.414l3.182-3.182-2.828-2.829a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.707c.688-.688 1.673-.767 2.375-.72a6 6 0 0 1 1.013.16l3.134-3.133a3 3 0 0 1-.04-.461c0-.43.108-1.022.589-1.503a.5.5 0 0 1 .353-.146m.122 2.112v-.002zm0-.002v.002a.5.5 0 0 1-.122.51L6.293 6.878a.5.5 0 0 1-.511.12H5.78l-.014-.004a5 5 0 0 0-.288-.076 5 5 0 0 0-.765-.116c-.422-.028-.836.008-1.175.15l5.51 5.509c.141-.34.177-.753.149-1.175a5 5 0 0 0-.192-1.054l-.004-.013v-.001a.5.5 0 0 1 .12-.512l3.536-3.535a.5.5 0 0 1 .532-.115l.096.022c.087.017.208.034.344.034q.172.002.343-.04L9.927 2.028q-.042.172-.04.343a1.8 1.8 0 0 0 .062.46z"/>
            </svg>
             Nouvelle réservation sur votre trajet</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Bonjour <strong>{{ driver.name }}</strong>,</p>
            
            <p>Un passager vient de réserver une place sur l'un de vos trajets!</p>

            <div class="ride-details">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #007bff;">Détails du trajet</h3>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="label">
                    {# pin Départ #}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-geo-alt" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                        <path d="M12.166 8.94c-.524 1.062-1.234 2.12-1.96 3.07A32 32 0 0 1 8 14.58a32 32 0 0 1-2.206-2.57c-.726-.95-1.436-2.008-1.96-3.07C3.304 7.867 3 6.862 3 6a5 5 0 0 1 10 0c0 .862-.305 1.867-.834 2.94M8 16s6-5.686 6-10A6 6 0 0 0 2 6c0 4.314 6 10 6 10"/>
                        <path d="M8 8a2 2 0 1 1 0-4 2 2 0 0 1 0 4m0 1a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6"/>
                    </svg>
                     De :</span> {{ ride.departure }}
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="label">
                    {# pin Arrivée #}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-geo-alt" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                        <path d="M12.166 8.94c-.524 1.062-1.234 2.12-1.96 3.07A32 32 0 0 1 8 14.58a32 32 0 0 1-2.206-2.57c-.726-.95-1.436-2.008-1.96-3.07C3.304 7.867 3 6.862 3 6a5 5 0 0 1 10 0c0 .862-.305 1.867-.834 2.94M8 16s6-5.686 6-10A6 6 0 0 0 2 6c0 4.314 6 10 6 10"/>
                        <path d="M8 8a2 2 0 1 1 0-4 2 2 0 0 1 0 4m0 1a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6"/>
                    </svg> 
                    Vers :</span> {{ ride.destination }}
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="label">
                    {# Temps #}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-alarm" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                        <path d="M8.5 5.5a.5.5 0 0 0-1 0v3.362l-1.429 2.38a.5.5 0 1 0 .858.515l1.5-2.5A.5.5 0 0 0 8.5 9z"/>
                        <path d="M6.5 0a.5.5 0 0 0 0 1H7v1.07a7.001 7.001 0 0 0-3.273 12.474l-.602.602a.5.5 0 0 0 .707.708l.746-.746A6.97 6.97 0 0 0 8 16a6.97 6.97 0 0 0 3.422-.892l.746.746a.5.5 0 0 0 .707-.708l-.601-.602A7.001 7.001 0 0 0 9 2.07V1h.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1zm1.038 3.018a6 6 0 0 1 .924 0 6 6 0 1 1-.924 0M0 3.5c0 .753.333 1.429.86 1.887A8.04 8.04 0 0 1 4.387 1.86 2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0 3.5M13.5 1c-.753 0-1.429.333-1.887.86a8.04 8.04 0 0 1 3.527 3.527A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 13.5 1"/>
                    </svg>
                     Départ :</span> {{ ride.departureTime|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="label">
                    {# Voiture #}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-car-front" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                        <path d="M4 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0m10 0a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0M6 8a1 1 0 0 0 0 2h4a1 1 0 1 0 0-2zM4.862 4.276 3.906 6.19a.51.51 0 0 0 .497.731c.91-.073 2.35-.17 3.597-.17s2.688.097 3.597.17a.51.51 0 0 0 .497-.731l-.956-1.913A.5.5 0 0 0 10.691 4H5.309a.5.5 0 0 0-.447.276"/>
                        <path d="M2.52 3.515A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4.82 2h6.362c1 0 1.904.596 2.298 1.515l.792 1.848c.075.175.21.319.38.404.5.25.855.715.965 1.262l.335 1.679q.05.242.049.49v.413c0 .814-.39 1.543-1 1.997V13.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5.5h-2a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5v-1.338c-1.292.048-2.745.088-4 .088s-2.708-.04-4-.088V13.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5.5h-2a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5v-1.892c-.61-.454-1-1.183-1-1.997v-.413a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 .049-.49l.335-1.68c.11-.546.465-1.012.964-1.261a.8.8 0 0 0 .381-.404l.792-1.848ZM4.82 3a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.379.91l-.792 1.847a1.8 1.8 0 0 1-.853.904.8.8 0 0 0-.43.564L1.03 8.904a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-.03.294v.413c0 .796.62 1.448 1.408 1.484 1.555.07 3.786.155 5.592.155s4.037-.084 5.592-.155A1.48 1.48 0 0 0 15 9.611v-.413q0-.148-.03-.294l-.335-1.68a.8.8 0 0 0-.43-.563 1.8 1.8 0 0 1-.853-.904l-.792-1.848A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 11.18 3z"/>
                    </svg>
                    Places restantes :</span> {{ ride.availableSeats }}
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="passenger-info">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #333;">Informations du passager</h3>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="label">
                    {# personne #}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-person" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                        <path d="M8 8a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6m2-3a2 2 0 1 1-4 0 2 2 0 0 1 4 0m4 8c0 1-1 1-1 1H3s-1 0-1-1 1-4 6-4 6 3 6 4m-1-.004c-.001-.246-.154-.986-.832-1.664C11.516 10.68 10.289 10 8 10s-3.516.68-4.168 1.332c-.678.678-.83 1.418-.832 1.664z"/>
                    </svg>
                    Nom :</span> {{ passenger.name }}
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="label">
                    {# email #}
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-envelope" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                        <path d="M0 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h12a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2zm2-1a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v.217l7 4.2 7-4.2V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1zm13 2.383-4.708 2.825L15 11.105zm-.034 6.876-5.64-3.471L8 9.583l-1.326-.795-5.64 3.47A1 1 0 0 0 2 13h12a1 1 0 0 0 .966-.741M1 11.105l4.708-2.897L1 5.383z"/>
                    </svg>
                    Email :</span> {{ passenger.email }}
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="label">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-telephone" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                        <path d="M3.654 1.328a.678.678 0 0 0-1.015-.063L1.605 2.3c-.483.484-.661 1.169-.45 1.77a17.6 17.6 0 0 0 4.168 6.608 17.6 17.6 0 0 0 6.608 4.168c.601.211 1.286.033 1.77-.45l1.034-1.034a.678.678 0 0 0-.063-1.015l-2.307-1.794a.68.68 0 0 0-.58-.122l-2.19.547a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.657-.459L5.482 8.062a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-.46-1.657l.548-2.19a.68.68 0 0 0-.122-.58zM1.884.511a1.745 1.745 0 0 1 2.612.163L6.29 2.98c.329.423.445.974.315 1.494l-.547 2.19a.68.68 0 0 0 .178.643l2.457 2.457a.68.68 0 0 0 .644.178l2.189-.547a1.75 1.75 0 0 1 1.494.315l2.306 1.794c.829.645.905 1.87.163 2.611l-1.034 1.034c-.74.74-1.846 1.065-2.877.702a18.6 18.6 0 0 1-7.01-4.42 18.6 18.6 0 0 1-4.42-7.009c-.362-1.03-.037-2.137.703-2.877z"/>
                    </svg>
                    Téléphone :</span> {{ passenger.phone ?? 'Non fourni' }}
                </div>
            </div>

            <p>Merci de contacter le passager pour confirmer les détails du trajet. N'oubliez pas de vérifier l'adresse de départ et toutes les informations importantes avant le départ.</p>

            <p>Bon trajet!</p>

            <div class="footer">
                <p>Cet email a été généré automatiquement par le système de covoiturage.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
